results.releaseNotes:
- Full iphoneX compatibility added;
- Keyboard pops up with the last used page now;
- Globe key was hidden on iphoneX to not duplicate system-provided button;
- Current page indicator became button. Press on it to cycle between pages;
- Fixed problem rearranging snippets.

[ Edit more smoothly. Capture more efficiently. ]
1. Editing Improvements: Fixed incorrect content when editing snippets;
2. iPad Improvements: Improved input switching and support for different screen sizes and split view;
3. Save Images to Scratchpad: Save images directly to Scratchpad from the system share sheet;
4. iCloud Sync Improvements: Improved multi-device data merging to reduce overwritten or restored content;
5. Web Updates: Added Scratchpad management and dynamic variables.
